*************************************************************************
*                    PARAMETERS OF THE FIT
*************************************************************************
 12          <= Number of degrees of freedom 
 5            <= Number of bond lengths
 7            <= Number of bond angles
   20           <= Number of iterations in the fit (0-no fit) -  IterMax
  1.d-10   1.d-5   <= stab_best, stadev_best: Stability and st. dev. of the fit 
  1.0000000000    <= conv_bond
  2.194746354d+05   <= conv_ener
 1.0000       <= Parameter is out  if FACTOR_OUT*|PARAM(I)|<|StErr(I)|
0.0000100    <= Parameter is back if (Delta StDev)/StDev >  FACTOR_back
1         <= Watson Robust fit on (1), off (0), or stand. from rob (2)
-0.001      < = tol SVD tolerence  
0.01       <=  fit_scale    
0.005     <= Partridge and Schwenke's gamma
10000.0    <= Partridge and Schwenke's Enermax
